{"id":"4ce9dc1a23afcd50","group":"93","path":"93/93-ex-nonalgebraizable.md","title":"First-Order Object Outside the Propositional Domain","display":"First-Order Object Outside the Propositional Domain","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ex-nonalgebraizable","aliases":["93-ex-nonalgebraizable"],"display":"First-Order Object Outside the Propositional Domain","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebraizable]]","[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-variable]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ex-nonalgebraizable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ex-nonalgebraizable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"First-Order Object Outside the Propositional Domain"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a55351eb48f8bd69\" href=\"?note=a55351eb48f8bd69\" title=\"93-df-algebraizable\">93-df-algebraizable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84c35fea1e867240\" href=\"?note=84c35fea1e867240\" title=\"93-df-first-order-formula\">93-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ce709e0d2857990\" href=\"?note=0ce709e0d2857990\" title=\"93-df-first-order-structure\">93-df-first-order-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"56c1f813209c75e1\" href=\"?note=56c1f813209c75e1\" title=\"93-df-first-order-satisfaction\">93-df-first-order-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"ex-nonalgebraizable---First-Order-Object-Outside-the-Propositional-Domain\">ex-nonalgebraizable - First-Order Object Outside the Propositional Domain</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> have the signatures of the cited first-order definitions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(T_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgLog}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgLog}\\)</span> are the sourced propositional-signature, propositional-formula, and algebraizable-logic constructions.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\">\\(\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\">\\(F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\">\\(\\Vdash^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\">\\(\\mathsf L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonalgebraizable}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\qquad\nF^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonalgebraizable}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle,\n\\qquad\nF^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonalgebraizable}\\vdash\n\\Vdash^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\n\\mathcal P(F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93})\\times F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}:{}&amp;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}}\\Gamma\n\\to\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}}\\varphi\n\\bigr)\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonalgebraizable}\\vdash\n\\Vdash^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\n\\mathcal P(F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93})\\times F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}:{}&amp;\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}}\\Gamma\n\\to\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}}\\varphi\n\\bigr)\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonalgebraizable}\\vdash\n\\mathsf L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93},\\Vdash^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonalgebraizable}\\vdash\n\\mathsf L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\coloneqq\n\\langle F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93},\\Vdash^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonalgebraizable}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93})\n\\land F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{93}=\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\;\\forall\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\to\nF^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\neq\nT_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\notin\\mathrm{AlgLog}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}nonalgebraizable}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93})\n\\land F^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{93}=\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\;\\forall\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\to\nF^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\neq\nT_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf L^{\\varnothing\\mathrm{FO}}_{93}\\notin\\mathrm{AlgLog}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This is a formal domain-boundary witness, not a claim that a propositional\nlogic fails the Blok--Pigozzi criteria.  Every propositional term algebra\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(T_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span> contains the nonempty set\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, whereas the tagged closed first-order formulas contain\nno raw variable.  Hence this first-order semantic-consequence object cannot\nhave the carrier required by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}\\)</span> and is not an element of\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgLog}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgLog}\\)</span>.  This says nothing against algebraic semantics for\nfirst-order logic in richer signatures and sorts.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"ex-nonalgebraizable---First-Order-Object-Outside-the-Propositional-Domain","text":"ex-nonalgebraizable - First-Order Object Outside the Propositional Domain","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebraizable","status":"resolved","id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locatio